LaminarForge - Open Source Licensing
=====================================

This project uses a triple-license structure to appropriately cover
hardware designs, software, and documentation.

Hardware Designs (CAD models, PCB layouts, schematics, mechanical drawings)
  License: CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)
  Full text: LICENSE-HARDWARE

Software (firmware, Rust source code, build scripts, tests, tools)
  License: GNU General Public License Version 3 (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  Full text: LICENSE-SOFTWARE

Documentation (protocols, design specs, guides, data)
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC-BY-SA-4.0)
  Full text: LICENSE-DOCS

SPDX License Identifiers:
  Hardware:      SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  Software:      SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Documentation: SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0

Copyright (c) 2026 LaminarForge contributors
